abstract: >-
  Miñano-Benítez SMS (Simultaneous Multiple Surface) lens surfaces as an
  Optiland plugin: a spline span of a ray-tracing-shapely profile.json
  becomes a sequential surface of revolution, sms_spline, traced exactly
  and, under Optiland's torch backend, differentiable with respect to the
  spline's points. Registered through Optiland's entry point; it depends
  on Optiland only.
